{"name":"Beluir","status":"ok","title":"Beluir","pageId":48635,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Beluir</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p195-196_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p195-196-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Settlement</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luiren\" title=\"Luiren\">Luiren</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Southeast_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Southeast Faerûn\">Southeast Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Metropolis</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p195-196_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p195-196-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><table class=\"percentagetable\"><tbody><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Halflings\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Halflings\">Halflings</a>  </td><td> 92%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Humans\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Humans\">Humans</a>  </td><td> 4%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Half-elf\" title=\"Half-elf\">Half-elves</a>  </td><td> 2%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Elves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elves\">Elves</a>  </td><td> 1%  </td></tr><tr><td> Other races  </td><td> 1% </td></tr></tbody></table><sup id=\"cite_ref-ShSo-p151_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ShSo-p151-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"established\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Established</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">14</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">27,210&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Calcitro_Burrow\" title=\"Calcitro Burrow\">Calcitro Burrow</a> (Mayor)<sup id=\"cite_ref-ShSo93-p47_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ShSo93-p47-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-ShSo-p151_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ShSo-p151-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Beluir\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Beluir\">Inhabitants of  Beluir</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Beluir\" title=\"Category:Locations in Beluir\">Locations in  Beluir</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Beluir\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Beluir\">Organizations in  Beluir</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Beluir&DPL_cat2=Settlements&action=purge\">Settlements  in  Beluir</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Beluir&DPL_cat2=Roads&action=purge\">Roads  in  Beluir</a></span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Events in Beluir (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6RXZlbnRzX2luX0JlbHVpcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Events in  Beluir</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Food_and_drink_from_Beluir\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Food and drink from Beluir\">Food and drink from  Beluir</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Items_from_Beluir\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Items from Beluir\">Items from  Beluir</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Beluir</b> was the largest city (usually considered the capital) of the <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">halfling</a> realm of <a href=\"/wiki/Luiren\" title=\"Luiren\">Luiren</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p195-196_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p195-196-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> it also housed foreign dignitaries. Its was also known for having the largest <a href=\"/wiki/Yondalla\" title=\"Yondalla\">Yondalla</a> temple in Luiren, and so also the home of the Devout Voice of Yondalla.<sup id=\"cite_ref-ShSo-p151_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ShSo-p151-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Defence\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Defence</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Resources</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Notable_locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Business\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Business</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Taverns\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Taverns</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Stores\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Stores</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Notable_inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beluir?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Beluir was located on the shore of <a href=\"/wiki/Luirenstrand\" title=\"Luirenstrand\">Luirenstrand Bay</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Sea\" title=\"Great Sea\">Great Sea</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-Map_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-Map-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beluir?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Beluir was established by Halflings in <a href=\"/wiki/14_DR\" title=\"14 DR\">14 DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-tGHotR-p60_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tGHotR-p60-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> In <a href=\"/wiki/1105_DR\" title=\"1105 DR\">1105 DR</a>, a powerful storm from the Great Sea destroyed most of the city, but it was rebuilt.<sup id=\"cite_ref-GHR-119_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-GHR-119-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p195-196_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p195-196-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Defence\">Defence</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Defence\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beluir?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Defence\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The city is well defended by about a cohort of <a href=\"/wiki/Warders\" title=\"Warders\">marchwardens</a> as well as a large group of militia. The marchswardens would use skirmishing tactics to surround and ultimately destroy a besieging army.<sup id=\"cite_ref-ShSo93-p47_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ShSo93-p47-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The Mayor of the town is known to have slain two <a href=\"/wiki/Hill_giant\" title=\"Hill giant\">Hill giants</a> on his own, they may have been drunk but he's still a fighter of renown.<sup id=\"cite_ref-ShSo-p151_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ShSo-p151-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\nThere was a network of portals leading to the temple of <a href=\"/wiki/Sheela_Peryroyl\" title=\"Sheela Peryroyl\">Sheela Peryroyl</a> from all over the country that had a garrison of fighters and priests.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Portals_of_the_Harvest_Gods_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Portals_of_the_Harvest_Gods-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\nThere were an order of swaying Halflings calling them self's Hin blades of <a href=\"/wiki/Brandobaris\" title=\"Brandobaris\">Brandobaris</a> that were based in the city. These trouble coursers came out to defend the realm whenever needed.<sup id=\"cite_ref-The_Sublime_Way_8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-The_Sublime_Way-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Resources\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beluir?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Resources\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The city had many farmlands and fruit farms nearby.<sup id=\"cite_ref-ShSo-p151_2-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ShSo-p151-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-ShSo93-p47_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ShSo93-p47-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_locations\">Notable locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beluir?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dt>Temple of Yondalla</dt>\n<dd>Led by the Devout Voice of Yondalla, the religious leader and thus <i>de facto</i> civil leader of Luiren.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p195-196_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p195-196-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt>Temple of Sheela Peryroyl</dt>\n<dd>This temple held a network of 8 one way portals that took wagons of food from other places of Luiren as far as near the border of <a href=\"/wiki/Shoun\" title=\"Shoun\">Shoun</a>. As well as a contingency of guards and priests.<sup id=\"cite_ref-Portals_of_the_Harvest_Gods_7-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Portals_of_the_Harvest_Gods-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Business\">Business</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Business\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beluir?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Business\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Most \"Big folk\" sized businesses are by the docks like \"Erdel’s Extraordinary Equipment Emporium\" and many types of hostels, taverns and inns. The docks of the city had a brisk shipping trade and the city also has a lot of homes for foreigners and their dignitaries. <sup id=\"cite_ref-ShSo-p151_2-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ShSo-p151-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Taverns\">Taverns</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Taverns\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beluir?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Taverns\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>Beluir has many taverns some famous:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Friendly_Burrow\" title=\"Friendly Burrow\">Friendly Burrow</a> - Burrow family owned tavern.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Red_Burrow\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Red Burrow\">the Red Burrow</a> - Burrow family owned tavern.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Cold_Duck\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Cold Duck\">the Cold Duck</a> - Burrow family owned tavern/inn, famous for the delicacy that inspired its name also has rooms for big folk.<sup id=\"cite_ref-ShSo-p151_2-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ShSo-p151-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stores\">Stores</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Stores\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beluir?veaction=edit&section=8\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Stores\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Erdel’s Extraordinary Equipment Emporium (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRXJkZWwlRTIlODAlOTlzX0V4dHJhb3JkaW5hcnlfRXF1aXBtZW50X0VtcG9yaXVtP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Erdel’s Extraordinary Equipment Emporium</span> A store catering to \"Big folk\" who's owner also was the leader of the local thieves guild.<sup id=\"cite_ref-ShSo-p151_2-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ShSo-p151-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_inhabitants\">Notable inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beluir?veaction=edit&section=9\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Faran_Ferromar\" title=\"Faran Ferromar\">Faran Ferromar</a>, Devout Voice of Yondalla in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p195-196_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p195-196-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Gringa Thistlehair (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR3JpbmdhX1RoaXN0bGVoYWlyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Gringa Thistlehair</span>, Devout Voice of Yondalla in <a href=\"/wiki/1373_DR\" title=\"1373 DR\">1373 DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-ShSo-p151_2-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ShSo-p151-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Calcitro_Burrow\" title=\"Calcitro Burrow\">Calcitro Burrow</a> A mayor and a fighter of renown.<sup id=\"cite_ref-ShSo93-p47_3-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ShSo93-p47-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Yannig Longtunnel (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvWWFubmlnX0xvbmd0dW5uZWw/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Yannig Longtunnel</span> Assistant mayor.</li>\n<li>Captain <span class=\"new\" title=\"Furl Mossfoot (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRnVybF9Nb3NzZm9vdD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Furl Mossfoot</span> first ranking marchwarden in the city area.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beluir?veaction=edit&section=10\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Beluir?veaction=edit&section=11\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS3e-p195-196-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p195-196_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup>